{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33982","headline":"鲁望以轮钩相示缅怀高致因作三篇 三 · 皮日休","name":"鲁望以轮钩相示缅怀高致因作三篇 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尽日悠然舴艋轻，小轮声细雨溟溟。\n三寻丝带桐江烂，一寸钩含笠泽腥。\n用近詹何传钓法，收和范蠡养鱼经。\n孤篷半夜无余事，应被严滩聒酒醒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}